=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e9e7ed41104d5e4547e765fc94370a25 3x"}, "body": "Hello ゆるSkebくずさん, I really love your art style💗\nThis time, could you please draw my original BL couple? Including the outfits and compositions, I’ll leave all to you! Please feel free to draw.\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1W3ntXmnQbOSwJva803Ou4ZGpQexlQESq\n\nピンク髪：年下の電波系男子高校生\n黒髪：明るい重い男社畜\n2人の関係性：黒髪はピンク髪を世話し溺愛する傾向があり、ピンク髪は黒髪に依存しつつも、過干渉になると苛立ちを見せる。\n\nIf the amount is not enough, please feel free to resend!\nThank you for your consideration.", "nc": 152, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@nmsg_kz/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3716160, "client_id": 2284664, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4d0a89c9/uploads/origins/a759c776-72c1-4b7c-95bc-00d4b1dd6762?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c73ceee640dc4805a1d2b8329a255d78", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4d0a89c9/uploads/origins/a759c776-72c1-4b7c-95bc-00d4b1dd6762?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c73ceee640dc4805a1d2b8329a255d78, https://si.imgix.net/4d0a89c9/uploads/origins/a759c776-72c1-4b7c-95bc-00d4b1dd6762?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=64f5ba95a76544987e99a5634e6171b5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4d0a89c9/uploads/origins/a759c776-72c1-4b7c-95bc-00d4b1dd6762?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef16bdacaeec79c109272cbf30eb85e5 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4d0a89c9/uploads/origins/a759c776-72c1-4b7c-95bc-00d4b1dd6762?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=11ce8b831c6e0846c4b4f487ccee7637", "srcset": "https: